Section: 3.1. Deriving Pseudo Labels
Text: We derive the pseudo labels when the following condi- tions are met: • Maximally p domains predicted with the highest conﬁ- dences that are higher than the conﬁdence of the known ground-truth. • Domains predicted with the highest conﬁdences for r times consecutively so that consistent top predictions are used as pseudo labels. For the experiments in Section 5, we use p=2 and r=4, which show the best dev set performance.

