Section: 3.2. Leveraging Negative Feedback
Text: We ﬁnd that it is more effective to ex- plicitly demote the prediction conﬁdences of the domains re- sulted in negative responses if they are top ranked. It is for- mulated as a loss function:  −log (1 −oj) ∀i̸ = j oi ≤oj Ln = 0 Otherwise, where j denotes the index corresponding to the negative ground-truth domain. We demote the conﬁdences of the negative ground-truths only when they are the highest so that the inﬂuence of using the negative ground-truths is not overwhelming.7

